      "id": "claim_9091f1e2b0a94fb3be496729c8136a83",
      "statement": "API-17 Statements & Documents API (v1.4, base path /documents/v1) is owned by Digital Platforms Engineering in the Client Servicing domain, serves the mobile app, online banking and corporate clients, classifies data as Confidential - Client Data, and has a 300 requests/minute rate limit and 99.9% availability SLO.",
